<title>USA: Photo Control names Helmen president, COO.</title>
<headline>Photo Control names Helmen president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Photo Control Corp said Monday John Helmen will join the company as president and chief operating officer, effective April 25.</p>
<p>Photo Control said L.A. Willig, who held the post of president, will continue as chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Photo Control designs and makes cameras, film and other photographic accessories.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
